# Jakarta migration conventions

- Prefer `jakarta.*` for EE APIs (servlet, persistence, validation, xml.bind). Do not introduce new `javax.*` EE imports.
- Leave JDK-only `javax.*` alone (e.g. crypto). Match `scripts/javax-count.sh`.
- Target stack: Java 21, Spring Boot 3.5, Tomcat 10.1, JUnit 5.
- Migrate in small batches. After each batch run `mvn verify` and `scripts/javax-count.sh`.
- Keep behaviour identical. No unrelated refactors.
- Plan the full migration first; execute one approved batch at a time.
